; and Affine/Point.lean. All ideal closures are checked proofs.
; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-ideals.py; checked native terms.
; Two-generator ideals are actual sums of principal
; ideals. Prove generator membership and minimality, introduce
; explicit two-coefficient witnesses and extract such witnesses from
; arbitrary membership. These are the shapes used by point ideals.
